    <detaileddescription>
<para>Manager for custom user-defined alert rules.</para>
<para>Provides a full CRUD API for alert rules plus an evaluation method that checks all enabled rules against a metric snapshot and fires/resolves alerts via an <ref refid="classthemis_1_1observability_1_1_alertmanager" kindref="compound">Alertmanager</ref> backend.</para>
<para>Thread-safety: all methods are thread-safe via an internal mutex.</para>
<para>Typical usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1observability_1_1_alert_rule_manager_1af17dbf04928fe145bd1ec3252a92a765" kindref="member">AlertRuleManager</ref><sp/>mgr;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">AlertRule<sp/>rule;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">rule.metric_name<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;themis_query_latency_p99_ms&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">rule.op<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1observability_1a2dfb6da99b532b521f591d84bf6e68c3a1625ef4fe09f68fa20d3ff6e02cd5c8e" kindref="member">AlertRuleOperator::GREATER_THAN</ref>;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">rule.threshold<sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/>500.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">rule.severity<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1observability_1a8ee1043d756365fbf3e4632ae5371c2fa059e9861e0400dfbe05c98a841f3f96b" kindref="member">AlertSeverity::WARNING</ref>;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">rule.message_template<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;P99<sp/>latency<sp/>{value}ms<sp/>exceeds<sp/>threshold&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>res<sp/>=<sp/>mgr.addRule(rule);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">mgr.evaluateRules(metric_snapshot,<sp/>alertmanager);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
